<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-MUNICH MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MUNICH MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the $425,000 Munich men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) beat 1-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 3-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>7-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-4 2-6 6-4</p>
<p>8-Mark Philippoussis (Australa) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-7 (2-7) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>6-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 7-5 2-6 6-1  </p>
<p>Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) beat Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat 5-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 4-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Martin Sinner (Germany) beat Marcelo Charpentier (Argentina) 6-2 4-1 (Charpentier withdrew injured)</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-4 6-7 (2-7) 7-5</p>
</text>
